1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,380
真不错 我们买了辆
Oh, great. we've got the Prius that can

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,380
能预订餐厅 买电影票
make dinner reservations, buy movie tickets,

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,280
预报天气的丰田普锐斯
tell us the weather.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,940
我只想要一辆门能打得开的车
I just want one that opens.

5
00:00:08,678 --> 00:00:10,988
也许我们该买那辆
Maybe we should've got that one.

6
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,260
米奇尔
Mitchell!

7
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,320
天呐 泰迪
Oh, oh, my God! Teddy!

8
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,160
小卡 这是泰迪
Cam, this is Teddy.

9
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,980
泰迪 泰迪 泰迪
Teddy, Teddy, Teddy.

10
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,240
医生 泰迪医生
Doc--Doctor Teddy!

11
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,280
泰迪是米奇在我之前的
Teddy was Mitch's one significant

12
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,700
一个比较重要的男友
boyfriend before me.

13
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,460
那时米奇刚出柜
Uh, Mitch had recently just come out.

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,720
就如他自己说的
And as he put it,

15
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:30,520
一个人如果不爱自己 就很难爱上别人
it was hard to love someone else if he couldn't love himself.

16
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,160
我真说过那种话吗
I actually said those words?

17
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,920
现在倒是很难爱我自己了
Ugh. It's kind of hard to love myself right now.

18
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,420
当年是你说 "我需要点时间
You were the one who said, "I need some time.

19
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,800
我疗好心伤后会再联系你的"
I'll call you when I heal more."

20
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,680
一晃都过去十年了
Ten years later...

21
00:00:40,215 --> 00:00:41,480
我从没那么说过
I never said that.

22
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,700
需要时间疗伤 真是甜蜜又敏感啊
Time to heal more! That's so sweet and sensitive.

23
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,200
你为什么要扼杀掉这种天性
Why did you kill that part of yourself?

24
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,260
我这周末要为医院举办一个募捐集会
You know, I'm hosting a fund-raiser for the hospital this weekend

25
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,720
就在南大街的旱冰场
at that roller rink on South Main.

26
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,000
你们能来吗
Any chance you guys can come?

27
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,160
-当然 -可能吧
- Yeah. Absolutely. - Possibly.

28
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:53,840
-我们一定去 -好吧
- We'll be there. - Okay.

29
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,004
太好了 周六4点见
Great. So 4:00 Saturday.

30
00:00:56,004 --> 00:00:58,200
我真的很高兴碰到你们
I'm so glad I bumped into y'all.

31
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,020
我们也是 说再见 莉莉
Us, too. Say bye, Lily!

32
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:01,080
再见 莉莉
Bye, Lily.

33
00:01:01,946 --> 00:01:03,298
我教她这样说的
I taught her that, so...

34
00:01:03,298 --> 00:01:05,387
-再见 莉莉 -再见 泰迪
- Bye, Lily. - Bye. Bye, Teddy.

35
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,720
天呐 他人真不错
Oh, my gosh, he's great!

36
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:10,560
你不介意跟我前男友共度周末吗
You're okay making plans with my ex-boyfriend?

37
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,740
不介意 都过去那么久了
Um, yes. It's been a hundred years.

38
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:15,300
而且这也是当基佬的众多好处之一
Plus, this is one of the many benefits of being gay.

39
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,980
我们能跟前任做朋友
We can be friends with our exes

40
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,380
而不像直男直女们那样
without all the petty jealousy

41
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:19,420
饱受妒火的煎熬
straight people go through.

42
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:21,520
我跟胡娇算是朋友 所以
Well, I guess I am friends with Pepper, so...

43
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,700
我只跟胡娇约会过一次 就一次
I went on one date with Pepper. One.

44
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,780
你什么时候才能不提这茬
When are you gonna stop bringing it up?

45
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,920
你反应不这么激烈的时候
When you stop reacting like that.

46
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:29,800
爸爸爱胡娇
Daddy loves Pepper.

47
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:31,180
我教她的
I taught her that.

48
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:46,320
那是隐私
That's private.

49
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,080
抱歉 但为什么上面列了我们的名字
Oh, sorry. But why do you have all of our names down on a list?

50
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,875
为了写作文
It's for my school essay--

51
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,820
要求是在家人中选一个英雄
pick a hero in your family

52
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,520
并写出你为什么选择他
and write about why you've chosen him or her.

53
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:54,980
你还是有望入选的
You're still in the running,

54
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:57,660
但我不喜欢你照看我弟弟时喝葡萄酒
But I'm not loving that you're drinking wine while watching my brother.

55
00:01:57,820 --> 00:02:01,180
是你家冰箱里有一瓶已经打开了的酒
Well, it was from an open bottle of white in your fridge, so...

56
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,140
这事关判断力 克莱尔
It's about judgment, Claire.

57
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,860
现在不是70年代了 我们都有常识的
It's not the 70's. We know better.

58
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:04,880
瓶子上有口红印
There was lipstick on the bottle.

59
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,280
我的宝贝们
There are my babies!

60
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,840
-晚餐怎么样 -非常完美
- How was dinner? - Perfect.

61
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,940
我吃了一份牛排 还有一些冰淇淋
I had a steak, I had some ice cream,

62
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:12,400
歌洛莉亚在她的鱼里发现了一根头发
Gloria found a hair in her fish,

63
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,620
结果餐厅给我们免单了
and it didn't cost us a penny!

64
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,440
也可能是我自己的头发
It might have been my own hair,

65
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,960
但杰很高兴我什么也没说
but Jay was so happy that I didn't say anything.

66
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:19,840
怎么了
What?

67
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:22,580
乖女儿 你走之前能抽点空吗
Honey, you got a second before you go?

68
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:23,660
我想跟你说点事
I wanna talk to you about something.

69
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:25,320
好吧 她为什么那样对我笑
All right. Why is she smiling at me like that?

70
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:26,740
是个好消息
It's good news.

71
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:27,520
好吧
Okay.

72
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,840
你记得我办公室的鲍勃吗
You remember Bob from my office?

73
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:31,500
记得啊 鲍勃叔叔 他变魔术
Yeah, uncle Bob. The one who did the trick

74
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:32,600
从我的耳朵里拿出一枚25分硬币
where he pulled a quarter out of my ear.

75
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,440
他后来又学了个魔术
He learned another trick.

76
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:35,480
从我们的养老金里掏走了5万美元
He pulled 50 grand out of our pension fund.

77
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,400
我把他炒了
Oh. I fired him.

78
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,500
但最糟糕的是
But the worst part is,

79
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,480
我当时正培养他接管公司
I was grooming him to take over the company.

80
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,560
但这事也有好的一面
But there's an upside.

81
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,400
他想让你为他工作
He wants you to work for him.

82
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,040
我知道现在只是普通工作而已
I know it's just a job right now,

83
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:46,040
但你知道他胸腔里不知得了什么毛病
but you know that he has this thing going on in his chest,

84
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,500
所以说不准什么时候
so you never know where

85
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:48,780
你就上位了 克莱尔
you're going to end up, Claire.

86
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:50,160
歌洛莉亚 我只是感冒而已
Gloria. Gloria, it's a cold.

87
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:51,460
总之 听着
Anyway, look,

88
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,200
我知道你一直想回归职场
I know you've been wanting to get back out there,

89
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,800
而我总是觉得 你要是重新开始工作
and I always kind of thought that if you did go back to work,

90
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,040
就该来跟我一块儿干
you'd come back to work with me.

91
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,660
我20年前在那里工作过半个暑假而已
I-I worked there for half a summer 20 years ago.

92
00:02:59,672 --> 00:03:01,140
那时你干得非常棒 乖女儿
And it-- it was terrific, honey.

93
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:03,300
听我说 显然 我们会慢慢培养你
Listen, obviously, we'll start you out slow.

94
00:03:03,309 --> 00:03:05,400
给你时间去重新了解这个公司
We'll give you time to re-learn about the place,

95
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,140
然后再提拔你 你是认识个关键人物的
and then maybe move you up. You know, you do know a guy.

96
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,060
他说的是他
He means him!

97
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:11,200
这机会太棒了 老爸 谢谢
It's a wonderful opportunity, dad. Thanks.

98
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,165
我能 我能考虑一下
Could I--could I think about it,

99
00:03:12,165 --> 00:03:12,811
-问问菲尔的意见吗 -当然
- talk to Phil? - Oh, sure.

100
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:15,000
-我明天再打给你 -好好好
- I'll call you tomorrow. - All right. All right. All right.

101
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,076
-我儿子呢 还我儿子 -儿子还你
- Where's my boy? Give me my boy. - Here's your man.

102
00:03:16,076 --> 00:03:18,320
小家伙还给你 真爱他
Here's your little man. Oh, love him.

103
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:21,680
关于这种"花"毯子我是怎么说的
What did I say about these flowered blankets for him?

104
00:03:22,972 --> 00:03:25,707
把他扮得越来越像那位"花花公子"了
He's starting to take after Hugh Hef-nerd over there.

105
00:03:25,707 --> 00:03:27,080
非常好笑 杰
Very amusing, Jay.

106
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,520
就让我把你的名字从这里划掉吧
Let me just get your name down here.

107
00:03:31,876 --> 00:03:34,060
又是社区大学寄来的宣传册
Another brochure from a community college.

108
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,760
我赌这些都是老妈让他们寄来的
You know, I bet mom is having them send these.

109
00:03:36,140 --> 00:03:37,900
是吗 你不觉得他们已经将你
Really? You don't think they've targeted you

110
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:38,800
锁定为必须招收的对象了吗
as a must-have recruit?

111
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:41,860
至少这一份没有矫揉造作的
At least this one doesn't have that fakey lunchtime shot

112
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:44,130
黑人亚裔妞儿印度人一起吃午餐的照片
of the black guy, asian girl, and an indian--

113
00:03:44,140 --> 00:03:45,680
等一下 在这儿呢
Oh, wait! There it is.

114
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,560
那坐轮椅的孩子把其他人都逗乐了
Wow, that wheelchair kid is really cracking everybody up.

115
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,520
闺女们 你们的妈妈就要带晚餐回来了
girls, your mom's on her way home with dinner!

116
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:51,860
就当我从没收到过这个
I never got this.

117
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:53,180
要是被他看见 又要找我谈话了
If he sees it, we'll have to talk about it.

118
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,000
怎么了
What?

119
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,440
什么怎么了
What what?

120
00:04:05,820 --> 00:04:07,820
如果外公打电话来 就说我不在家
If grandpa calls, I'm not home.

121
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:08,740
怎么了
What happened?

122
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:10,840
他想让我为他工作
He wants me to work for him.

123
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,361
培养我接管他的生意什么的
Like, groom me to take over or something.

124
00:04:13,371 --> 00:04:14,740
我不知道该怎么拒绝
I don't know how I'm gonna say no.

125
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:15,500
你为什么要拒绝
Why would you say no?

126
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,720
你不是正要找工作吗
I thought you were looking for something.

127
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,400
而且我们也能增加收入啊
We could use the money, too,

128
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,400
尤其是万一海莉决定回去念书的话
especially if Haley decides to go back to school.

129
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,100
她还是把那些学校的宣传册都扔掉吗
Oh, is she still throwing out those college brochures?

130
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,320
刚才还扔了一份
Just tossed one now.

131
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,568
她以为是谁在负责倒垃圾啊
Who does she think empties the trash?

132
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:26,440
知道最惨的是什么吗
You know what really sucks?

133
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,100
那份工作本来挺不错的
That job could be great.

134
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:30,800
但我爸是个糟糕的老板 他太刻薄了
But my dad is a terrible boss. He is so mean.

135
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,080
"大小姐 咖啡壶是不会给自己洗澡的"
"Princess, coffeepot's not gonna wash itself."

136
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,160
原来你是从他那里学的
That's where you got that?

137
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:35,880
我就跟你说过一次
I said it to you one time.

138
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,740
那你直接告诉他好了 开诚布公
Well, you just gotta tell him straight up, man to man.

139
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:40,260
开诚布"母" 你的身材真棒
Woman to man. You're very shapely.

140
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:41,480
我知道 我会说的
I know. I will.

141
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,580
我只是非常讨厌那种感觉
It's just I hate it so much.

142
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:46,300
我让他非常失望的那4次
The--the four big times that I disappointed him,

143
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,920
让我很难受
it devastated me.

144
00:04:48,003 --> 00:04:50,520
第一次是我剪短了我的头发
I mean, the first time, I cut off all my hair.

145
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,300
我去了别的州上大学
I went to college out of state.

146
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:55,502
我把他的复古车撞到了墙上
I crashed his vintage jag into a wall.

147
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,700
才三次啊
That's only three.

148
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,820
孩子们 吃饭了
Kids, dinner!

149
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,380
已经开始爱上这个了
Oh, loving this already.

150
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:07,500
如果没人摔成脑震荡的话
If no one gets a concussion,

151
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,500
我们一定会再来的
we're totally coming back.

152
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,640
听着 如果你觉得看到我和泰迪在一起
So listen, if at any point you're not okay

153
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,060
有什么不舒服的感觉
with seeing me and Teddy together,

154
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,760
就直接告诉我 我们可以走的
just please let me know, and we can go.

155
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,920
好的 谢谢你 如果你觉得
Oh, well, thank you. And if at any point

156
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:18,340
我对这事如此坦然 让你有些不舒服的话
you're not okay with me being so okay with it,

157
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:19,820
你也要告诉我
you let me know.

158
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,720
泰迪 泰迪 你好
Teddy! Teddy! Hey!

159
00:05:22,954 --> 00:05:24,839
看看你
Aw, look at you!

160
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:27,640
这件T恤太美了 你真可爱
This shirt is fantastic. You're adorable.

161
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,320
你更可爱
You're adorable!

162
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,620
我觉得有人被迷住喽
Oh, I think somebody has a crush!

163
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,320
非常感谢你请我们来
Thank you so much for having us.

164
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:35,100
我都分不出我的两个妞儿谁更兴奋了
I don't know which one of my girls is more excited.

165
00:05:35,112 --> 00:05:37,000
好了 过来 我们给你找双旱冰鞋
okay. Come on, let's get you some skates.

166
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,180
我想让泰迪一起来
I want Teddy to come.

167
00:05:38,180 --> 00:05:40,466
亲爱的 我想泰迪一定还有别的事
Oh, honey, I-I'm sure Teddy has other things--

168
00:05:40,466 --> 00:05:42,536
没关系 你们去吧 叙叙旧
No, no! You guys go! Catch up.

169
00:05:42,546 --> 00:05:44,525
-我先穿鞋 -好的
- I'll lace up. - Okay.

170
00:05:44,525 --> 00:05:46,041
可以走了吗
Okay, ready?

171
00:05:46,041 --> 00:05:47,999
-玩开心点 -小卡舅夫
- Have fun, okay! - Hey, uncle Cam!

172
00:05:48,153 --> 00:05:50,490
我的天 怎么回事
Oh, my gosh! Hey! What's--what's going on?

173
00:05:50,490 --> 00:05:52,140
你们怎么会在这里
What--what are you guys doing here?

174
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:53,940
-泰迪邀请我们来的 -你们认识泰迪
- Teddy invited us. - You guys know Teddy.

175
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:55,300
-那是当然 -没错 泰迪棒极了
- Yeah, totally. - Yeah, Teddy's great.

176
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:56,540
注意了 业余爱好者们
Heads up, amateurs!

177
00:05:57,260 --> 00:06:00,680
摇滚时间到 你们听到了没
It's time to rock 'n' roll! Do you get it?

178
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:02,800
小卡 你在这里做什么
Cam, what are you doing here?

179
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,240
见鬼 爸爸来了
Oh, hell, it's dad.

180
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,965
谁爸爸 不是你爸爸吧
Whose dad? Not your dad.

181
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,660
我一整天都没接他的电话
I have been avoiding his calls all day.

182
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:09,808
-快 菲尔 把我推远点 -走你
- Quick, Phil, slingshot me. - All right.

183
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,800
孩子们 林波舞滑法[后仰穿过横杆]
Oh. Limbo skate, kids.

184
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,300
你的身段能放多低
How low can you go?

185
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:16,460
周六晚上 我居然和家人在
I'm at a roller rink with my family

186
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:18,280
旱冰场玩 还能更低吗
on a Saturday night. I win.

187
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:20,940
我得给莉莉照张相
I have got to get a photo of Lily.

188
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,740
泰迪把她逗得前仰后合的
Teddy's making her giggle so hard.

189
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:24,940
人人都爱...泰迪
Oh, well, everybody loves... Teddy, so...

190
00:06:25,533 --> 00:06:27,720
但你要是介意的话 就告诉我
But you'll let me know if you're not okay.

191
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:30,020
米奇尔 你知道你全家人都被你前男友
Mitchell, do you know your entire family's here,

192
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:31,760
邀请来了吗
invited by your ex-boyfriend?

193
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,740
菲尔和克莱尔 杰和歌洛莉亚
Phil and Claire, Jay and Gloria,

194
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:34,880
还有你堂兄皮特
your cousin Pete.

195
00:06:37,074 --> 00:06:38,980
小卡 这是场募捐活动 好吗
C--it's a-- it's a fund-raiser, all right?

196
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:41,440
我想他一定是把自己所有联系人都请来了
I'm sure he just invited everyone on his contact list.

197
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,380
那倒是能说得通
Oh, well, that makes sense.

198
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:45,980
是啊 当然了
Yes, of course it does.

199
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,420
还有 我受宠若惊
and... I'm flattered.

200
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,780
为什么你会受宠若惊
Why are you flattered?

201
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,780
-你懂的啦 -我不懂
- You know. - I don't.

202
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,280
你懂的
You do!

203
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:56,400
我真不懂
I really don't!

204
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:03,100
歌洛莉亚 穿上溜冰鞋跟我去冰上旋转
Gloria, throw on those skates and take a whirl with me.

205
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:04,020
我非常想去
Oh, I totally would,

206
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:06,477
但我在照顾莉莉 她不想滑冰
but I'm taking care of Lily and she doesn't want to.

207
00:07:06,488 --> 00:07:07,400
我想滑
Oh. Yes, I do.

208
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,160
不 你不想 你之前告诉过我的
No, you don't. You told me before.

209
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:10,980
你不记得了吗 我怎么会撒谎呢
You don't remember? Why would I lie?

210
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:12,660
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

211
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,060
你不会滑旱冰
You don't know how to roller-skate.

212
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:17,880
我当然会了 我没什么不会的
Of course I do. I know how to do everything.

213
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,620
对着你我真是撒不了谎
I can't lie to that face.

214
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,660
幸好我嫁的人不是你
It's a good thing that we're not married.

215
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,400
我不...
Well, I don't...

216
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:28,720
我不会滑冰 我是个优雅的女子
I can't skate. I am an elegant woman.

217
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,500
那意味着我永远也不去做
That means that I never do

218
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:33,020
那少数几件我做得不太完美的事情
the few things that I don't really do that good.

219
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,580
可我是个天生的滑冰老师
But I'm a natural teacher.

220
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:36,520
但我会看起来很蠢
But I'm going to look stupid.

221
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:37,280
歌洛莉亚
Gloria...

222
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,520
相信我
Trust me.

223
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,580
只要站在我身边
As long as you're standing next to me,

224
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:42,660
你就不会看起来很蠢
you will not look stupid.

225
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:46,160
太好了 都没地方坐了
Oh, thank god! There is no place to sit.

226
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,692
我总会给亲爱的侄女们留位置的
Always room at my table for my darling nieces.

227
00:07:48,692 --> 00:07:50,480
被你们先抢了
Uhh... You beat us to it.

228
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,060
我们正准备问这小孩能不能一起坐呢
We were gonna ask this kid if we could share.

229
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,400
他就要走了
Well, he was just leaving.

230
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:55,060
你们完全可以过来一起坐
Yeah, you can totally sit with us.

231
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:57,780
我当时甚至不想把你们两个写进名单
You know, I debated even putting you two on here.

232
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,100
漂亮哦
Whoa, fancy.

233
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:04,100
我知道 我可是曾在这里工作过的
Yeah, I know. Well, I did used to work here.

234
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:06,954
等等 你是洗手间墙上照片里那个克莱尔
W-w-wait. You're the Claire from the bathroom?

235
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:08,640
那照片还在呢
Oh, is it still here?

236
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:09,900
是的
Y-yeah... oh...

237
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:11,880
看看你俩 多年未见
Oh! Hey! Look at you two catching up

238
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:14,000
-聊得真欢乐 -没那么久
- after all these years. - Well, it hasn't been that long.

239
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,460
也就一个月前 艾丽克斯得了流感
It's been like a month since you came by

240
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:17,100
-他还来过呢 对吧 -没开玩笑吧
- when Alex had the flu, right? - Oh, no kidding!

241
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:19,220
我还在她家吃了顿家常饭呢
Well, I do get a home-cooked meal out of it.

242
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,080
而且我欠他们个人情
Plus I owe these guys.

243
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,320
我最近两次买房 菲尔帮了不少忙
Phil helped me buy my last two houses.

244
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,920
真棒 多好的一段故事
Oh. So good. Such great stories.

245
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,356
-是啊 -叫你呢
- Yeah. - Hey, you!

246
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,960
你怎么不给我回电话
You owe me a phone call!

247
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,380
我知道 我会打给你的
I know! I'm gonna call you!

248
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,360
泰迪在这里
Hey! Teddy's here, huh?

249
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,420
你个赖账的 打高尔夫还欠我50块呢
Hey, you deadbeat, you owe me 50 bucks for the golf.

250
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:36,760
等你下次前列腺检查时我再塞给你
Well, maybe I'll slip it to you during your next prostate exam.

251
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:39,200
我打赌你就盼着那天了 小变态
I'll bet you're counting the days, you perv.

252
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,050
真有趣啊
Oh. So funny.

253
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,740
你和杰还真有话说呀 是吧
You and Jay really seem to have a thing, don't ya?

254
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,800
你和歌洛莉亚关系怎么样
And Gloria--what's the nature of your relationship with her?

255
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,420
事实上 我们今晚第一次见面
Well, actually, we just met tonight.

256
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:49,100
我不是很确定她喜不喜欢我
You know, I'm not so sure she likes me.

257
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,600
真的吗
Really?

258
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,320
我是说 她需要点时间才能熟络
Uh, well, I mean, she just takes a little time to warm up.

259
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:56,440
谢谢 也谢谢你今晚能过来
Oh, thanks. And thank you, again, for coming tonight.

260
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,220
利用筹集的这些钱 我们可以
With the money we raised, we'll be able

261
00:08:58,220 --> 00:09:00,460
给4千多个有需要的孩子接种疫苗
to inoculate over 4,000 needy kids

262
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:02,500
抵御一些非常可怕的疾病
against some truly awful diseases.

263
00:09:03,540 --> 00:09:04,600
你跟卢克关系怎么样
And how well do you know Luke?

264
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:06,980
我也喜欢那部电影
I love that movie, too!

265
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,760
在上海摩天大楼上的那场打斗戏太帅了
Yeah, that cool fight scene on that skyscraper in Shanghai--

266
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,480
让我好想去日本
It really made me want to go to Japan.

267
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,000
为什么 上海在中国
Why? Shanghai's in China.

268
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,180
我是说 你可不想飞到日本
I'm just saying, you don't want to fly to Japan,

269
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:17,060
然后打车说 "送我去上海市中心"
get in a cab and say, "Take me to downtown Shanghai."

270
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:18,920
那可太贵了
It's a pretty expensive ride.

271
00:09:20,668 --> 00:09:22,520
我要去趟厕所
Uh, um, I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

272
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,460
跟我一起去
Come with me.

273
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,740
马上回来哦 帅哥们
Be right back, guys.

274
00:09:27,423 --> 00:09:29,300
你在干什么
Uh, what do you think you're doing out there?

275
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:31,580
-我在勾搭啊 -这就是我担心的
- I'm flirting. - That's what I was afraid of.

276
00:09:31,580 --> 00:09:33,240
我可不会为了让一个男生喜欢我
Look, I'm not gonna pretend I'm stupid

277
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,180
-就故意装傻 -当然不
- just so a boy will like me. - Of course not.

278
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:37,480
但你不一定要贬低那可怜的男孩
But you don't have to put the poor guy to shame.

279
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:40,180
勾搭男人是要增加你自己的魅力
Flirting with boys is about increasing your value,

280
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:41,440
不是去打压他们
not decreasing theirs.

281
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:45,220
真是复杂 你在哪本杂志里学到的
That's a complicated thought. What magazine taught you that?

282
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:46,760
你又来了 又贬低他人
You're doing it again! The mean thing.

283
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,100
你自己有没有意识到啊
Can you even hear it or what?!

284
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:50,660
-我意识到了 -好
- I heard it. - Good.

285
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:52,980
现在他知道你很聪明了
So now that he knows that you're smart,

286
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:54,740
我们来试着表现得温柔些
let's work on being nice.

287
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,601
-把帽衫脱掉好吗 -不
- Wanna ditch the hoodie? - No.

288
00:09:56,601 --> 00:09:58,801
没事没事 慢慢来
That's all good. It's a process.

289
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:01,520
哥们 在这家里想找出个英雄很难吧
Man, tough finding a hero in this family, huh?

290
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:04,140
我自己也有很多麻烦事
You know, I've got problems of my own.

291
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:07,100
我不可能总是配合你演出
I can't always be the lovable sidekick on "The Manny show."

292
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:09,260
你难道没有发现我在暴饮暴食吗
Did you even notice I'm binge-eating?

293
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,220
看来你真的有心事
You're really going through something.

294
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,580
想谈谈吗
Wanna talk about it?

295
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:14,860
一点也不想
Not even a little bit.

296
00:10:14,980 --> 00:10:17,200
也别像往常一样烦我
And don't go hounding me like you always do.

297
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,620
多谢你重建我对这个家庭的信心
Well, thanks for restoring my faith in this family.

298
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,220
我要是泰迪的亲戚就好了
Too bad I'm not related to Teddy.

299
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,920
-他这人似乎很棒 -可不是嘛
- He seems terrific. - Doesn't he, though?

300
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:24,840
屈膝
Knees bent.

301
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:27,640
放松手臂 挺胸
Arms loose. Chin up.

302
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:28,900
提臀
Butt out.

303
00:10:29,423 --> 00:10:31,258
不行 菲尔 太难了
Ay, no, Phil. This is too much.

304
00:10:31,258 --> 00:10:32,642
记住口诀 "屈松挺提"
No, just remember, "Kbalcubo."

305
00:10:32,642 --> 00:10:34,026
屈 松 挺 提
K-b-a-l-c-u-b-o.

306
00:10:34,026 --> 00:10:36,332
就是"屈膝放松手臂挺胸提臀"
"Koala bears always lose cherries under big overpasses."

307
00:10:36,332 --> 00:10:39,069
这么长 我怎么记得住啊
Ay, no! How am I gonna remember all that?!

308
00:10:39,069 --> 00:10:40,637
我扶住你了
I gotcha.

309
00:10:41,724 --> 00:10:43,600
泰迪 你真帅呆了
Ay, Teddy... Teddy, you're amazing!

310
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,800
谢谢你救了我
Thank you for saving me!

311
00:10:46,020 --> 00:10:47,500
小子 让一让 让我来一拳
Let me get in there, boys. Excuse me.

312
00:10:49,002 --> 00:10:50,004
走你
Boom!

313
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,200
好啦
Okay!

314
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:54,000
好啦 是时候聊聊了
Okay, clearly it's time to talk.

315
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,540
小卡 你显然是生气了
All right, Cam, Cam, you're obviously upset.

316
00:10:56,540 --> 00:10:57,580
但你要相信我
But trust me--

317
00:10:57,580 --> 00:11:00,080
我和泰迪绝对没有藕断丝连
there are no lingering feelings between me and Teddy.

318
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,380
我才不在乎你和泰迪的事
I don't care about you and Teddy.

319
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,960
我是不喜欢他和你们家人藕断丝连
I don't like what's lingering between him and your family.

320
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,660
-什么 -米奇尔 你看看
- What? - Mitchell, look around.

321
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:08,193
你家人都在背叛我 和你的前男友厮混
Your family is cheating on me with your ex-boyfriend.

322
00:11:08,193 --> 00:11:10,873
背叛 好吧 他们的关系确实
Cheating--okay, yes. Th-there is a bit more contact

323
00:11:10,873 --> 00:11:12,334
比我知道的要更亲密一点 但是
between them than I realized, but--

324
00:11:12,345 --> 00:11:14,258
是嘛 你又要怪我太敏感
Oh, o-oh, yeah. Now this is where we make Cam

325
00:11:14,258 --> 00:11:15,740
怪我小题大做了
the over-sensitive drama queen.

326
00:11:15,740 --> 00:11:18,600
就是不能为了我做出些改变
God forbid we take any action to make things right for me.

327
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:20,600
好好好 那你想要我怎么做
Well, okay, okay. Okay, what do you want me to do?

328
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:23,200
要我叫他们跟泰迪"分手"吗
Would you like me to ask them to break up with Teddy?

329
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,320
你是想让我这么做吗
Is that what you're asking?

330
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:27,060
当然不是 我绝不会提那种要求
Of course not. I would never ask that.

331
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,500
-那样也太疯狂了 -那就好
- That would be insane. - Well, good.

332
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,760
我如果那样要求 就太疯狂了
It would be as insane for me to ask that

333
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,580
但你主动提出来 就非常识趣
as it would be sane for you to offer it.

334
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,480
所以你就是要我那么做
So that is what you're asking.

335
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,100
不 我才没要你那么做
No, that's what I'm not asking.

336
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:38,300
但如果你要那么做 我希望你是自愿的
But if you decide to do it, I want it to come from you,

337
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:38,960
而不是我逼你的
Not me,

338
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
因为我显然没有那样要求你
because I'm clearly not asking for it.

339
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:43,120
-好吧 真是无理取闹 -是吗
- Okay, this is nuts. - Is it?

340
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,660
我千方百计 辛辛苦苦
I worked my fingers to the bone

341
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:46,500
讨你家的老顽固们的欢心
to get these jumpy protestants to love me,

342
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:48,840
现在却发现 他们和你的前男友
and now I find out they're holding a torch

343
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,540
打得火热 不可开交
for the man who came before me?

344
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:53,540
我不是无理取闹 我很痛心
It's not nuts. It's actually quite painful.

345
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,280
先生 打扰一下 您得奖了
Excuse me, sir? You just won a prize

346
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,120
您刚刚在拳击游戏机上创造了新记录
for setting a rink record on the boxing machine.

347
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,520
可以给您照张相
If you wouldn't mind taking a picture

348
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,240
贴在我们的光荣榜上吗
for our wall of fame?

349
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,371
当然可以 我一会儿就来
Oh, yeah, sure. Absolutely. Just one second.

350
00:12:02,381 --> 00:12:04,060
开心吧
That's exciting.

351
00:12:04,276 --> 00:12:06,160
米奇尔 我知道你会做正确的事
Mitchell, I know you'll do what's right.

352
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:08,900
除非你喜欢看着我受辱
Unless you like seeing me humiliated.

353
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,420
谢谢
Thank you.

354
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:21,000
菲尔 大家都在盯着我
Everybody was staring, Phil.

355
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:23,340
要不我们到外面没人能看见的地方练习
Well, what if we practice outside where no one can see us?

356
00:12:24,451 --> 00:12:27,409
我都紧张得打嗝了
Ay, and now I have the nervous burps!

357
00:12:27,409 --> 00:12:28,950
克莱尔
Oh... Claire.

358
00:12:28,961 --> 00:12:31,160
爸 你在这儿干嘛
Dad? Wh-what are you doing out here?

359
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:33,180
显然这是今晚找你聊聊的唯一办法
Apparently this is the only way we'll get to talk tonight.

360
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:34,000
关于工作的事
About this job.

361
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,480
同志们
Hey, guys.

362
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,160
好像有要紧事 爸 等会儿聊
This sounds really important, dad. Hang on.

363
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:38,000
米奇尔 你继续
Go ahead, Mitchell.

364
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:39,820
听我说 这是我本人的想法
Okay, so listen. This is coming from me.

365
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:42,100
没人逼我 我需要你们帮个忙
No one else. But I need you to do something,

366
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,980
-而且我不想你们吐槽我 -老天爷
- And I don't want you to give me any flack. - Oh, jeez.

367
00:12:43,980 --> 00:12:46,060
你这就是在吐槽 我觉得你们
That's flack. I-I think it's a little weird

368
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:48,140
还和泰迪那么亲近很奇怪
how you all still hang out with Teddy so much...

369
00:12:48,380 --> 00:12:48,500
我早说嘛
Told you.

370
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:51,400
我觉得 你们以后最好还是
And I think it'd be appropriate if maybe you all,

371
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,711
别再跟他来往了
you know, stopped seeing him.

372
00:12:52,711 --> 00:12:54,646
这话是小卡让你说的 对吧
This is coming from Cam, isn't it?

373
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:56,220
不 不是
No, it's not.

374
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:57,480
慢着
Wait a second.

375
00:12:57,840 --> 00:13:00,340
小卡觉得我们不能同时喜欢他和泰迪吗
Cam doesn't think we can love him and Teddy at the same time?

376
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:03,040
而且你就这么出卖了小卡
And you just sold Cam out like that?

377
00:13:04,688 --> 00:13:06,260
等等 那是什么
Wait. What is that?

378
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:08,180
我告诉你是什么 是悲剧
I'll tell you what it is. It's sad.

379
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,560
各位顾客 请别慌张
Hey, skaters! Not an emergency,

380
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,840
我们的小吃店发生了小火灾
but we do have a small fire in the snack bar.

381
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:15,900
请大家有秩序地离开现场 谢谢
We'd like everyone to calmly file outside. Thanks.

382
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:17,600
各位 出口在这边
Okay, everyone, the exit's over here.

383
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:18,760
大家往这边走
Come this way, please.

384
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,076
走这边出来吧
Hey, this way, to the exit.

385
00:13:20,076 --> 00:13:21,436
来吧 大家快从这边出来
All right, everybody over here.

386
00:13:22,358 --> 00:13:24,080
-快啊 -你们帮帮我吧
- Come on. - You guys, just do this for me.

387
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:26,100
可是他离我们那么远
But... he's all the way over there.

388
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:26,880
你们"不用急"
There's no hurry.

389
00:13:26,892 --> 00:13:28,618
我们可是在70年代建造的木建筑里
We're in a wooden box built in 1970.

390
00:13:28,629 --> 00:13:29,936
-快走吧 -好 走吧
- Let's go! - Oh--all right, let's go.

391
00:13:29,936 --> 00:13:32,140
谢谢你们 你们真"好"
Okay, thank you. That's very nice.

392
00:13:32,140 --> 00:13:32,720
真是太"贴心"了
Sweet of you.

393
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:34,900
各位 好消息
Hey, skaters, good news!

394
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:36,060
火已经被扑灭了
Fire's out!

395
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:37,800
抱歉让你们受惊了
Sorry for the scare.

396
00:13:39,114 --> 00:13:41,200
好啦好啦 先别生气
All right--all right, before you get upset,

397
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,520
这只是因为那边比较方便
this was just about convenience.

398
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:43,300
是吗
Was it?

399
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:45,400
还是在暗中向我表态
Or was it a perfect metaphor?

400
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:47,100
米奇尔 恭喜你
Congratulations, Mitchell.

401
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:50,278
这是我有生以来最难过的一次滑旱冰经历
This is the saddest I've ever been in roller skates.

402
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:53,660
小心点
Okay, be careful.

403
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:56,160
我不想受伤
I don't want to get hurt, okay?

404
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:58,338
-没人会受伤的 -抓紧我
- No one's gonna get hurt. - Hold on!

405
00:13:58,338 --> 00:13:59,552
疼死我了
Aah! That hurts!

406
00:13:59,552 --> 00:14:01,500
我们能不能
Okay, if we could just...

407
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:02,720
我"米"了个"奇"的
Son of a Mitchell!

408
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:05,380
一点也别担心
Do not worry one bit.

409
00:14:05,390 --> 00:14:07,335
你就快学会了
You are gettin' it!

410
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,800
我们还是离车远点 行不
Let's get away from the cars, huh?

411
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:12,940
好恶心
Disgusting.

412
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:15,200
克莱尔·普里契特
Claire Pritchett?

413
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,480
-杰夫 -真的是你
- Jeff? - No way!

414
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,980
你从这里辞职后我就再没见过你
I haven't seen you since you worked here.

415
00:14:18,990 --> 00:14:21,720
你 你还在这工作啊
You... you still do.

416
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,740
是的 做自己喜欢的工作
Yeah, do what you love,

417
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,820
-工作也就不再是苦差事了 对吧 -对
- you never work a day in your life, right? - Right.

418
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:25,540
碰到你太好了
This is perfect.

419
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:27,040
刚才有个人在溜冰场上吐了
Some civilian just yakked in the rink.

420
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,160
你能不能帮我照看一下柜台
Can you take over for a minute?

421
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:29,884
不能
Um... no.

422
00:14:29,884 --> 00:14:31,660
这是我赚钱最多的地方
Ah, it's kind of where I make most of my money.

423
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,000
我不想把它关了
You know, I hate to shut it down.

424
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:36,400
我把一姑娘肚子搞大了 这事说来话长
Ah, I got a girl pregnant. It's a whole thing.

425
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:38,220
-好吧 我暂时照看一下 -太好了
- All right. I'll do it for a minute, sure. - Great.

426
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:39,520
-太谢谢你了 -行了
- Thank you. Thank you. - Okay.

427
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:40,560
-对了 -什么事
- Oh, hey... - Yeah?

428
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,960
我还在回味那个吻
I still think about that kiss.

429
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,680
老天啊
Oh, god.

430
00:14:49,059 --> 00:14:51,000
太恶心了
Gross.

431
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,720
妈妈 我刚刚吐了
Mom, I threw up.

432
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:55,660
亲爱的 那人是你啊 你会没事的
Oh, honey, that was you? You're gonna be okay.

433
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:57,285
我来找点东西安抚一下你的肚肚
Let me get you something for your tummy.

434
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,120
我压力太大了
I'm just so stressed out.

435
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:01,340
你知道我要写的那篇英雄的作文吗
You know that hero essay I have to write?

436
00:15:02,079 --> 00:15:04,760
爸爸想当然地以为我写的是他
Well, dad kind of assumed I wrote it about him...

437
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,820
但我没写他
But I didn't.

438
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:07,580
他现在要读我的作文
And now he wants to read it,

439
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:08,840
我不知道该怎么办
and I don't know what to do.

440
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:11,640
别担心你爸 我相信他会理解的
Don't worry about your father. I am sure he'll understand.

441
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:13,900
克莱尔 我来给卡梅隆拿点冰块
Claire, I need some ice for Cameron.

442
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:16,340
还有 我们得谈谈工作的事情
And we have to talk about the job.

443
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:17,960
除非你决定回到这里工作了
Unless you've taken back this one.

444
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,600
爸 我在招呼顾客呢
Dad, I'm with a customer right now.

445
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:20,800
马上就来跟你谈
I'll be with you in just a moment.

446
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:25,240
亲爱的 我会跟你爸爸谈
Honey, I'll talk to your dad.

447
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:27,860
你觉得他不会因为我写的是你而生气吧
You don't think he'll be upset I wrote it about you?

448
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:29,540
你写的是我吗
You wrote it about me?

449
00:15:29,732 --> 00:15:31,660
妈妈 你知道我一般怎么做作业
Mom, you know me and homework.

450
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:34,360
我没太动脑子 什么是英雄
I didn't give it much thought. What's a hero?

451
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,260
一个无所畏惧的人
Someone who's not afraid of anything,

452
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:38,680
一个强大的人 那就是你啊
and who's strong-- that's you.

453
00:15:39,005 --> 00:15:40,846
可爸爸也很棒
But dad's so great, too.

454
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:42,400
-我又要吐了 -好了好了
- Here it comes. - Okay. All right.

455
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:43,920
你赶紧坐下来 坐下 宝贝
You just sit down. Sit down, sweet pea.

456
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,748
把这个喝了 你会没事的
Have your drink. You're gonna be fine.

457
00:15:49,023 --> 00:15:50,567
真心话时间到
Here goes. Um...

458
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:53,880
爸爸 上次我们一起工作的时候
So, dad, the last time we worked together,

459
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,860
-我们的关系很紧张 -什么
- it was tense between us. - What?

460
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,760
-没有啊 -有的
- No, it wasn't. - Yes, it was.

461
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:00,608
你对我非常严厉
You were--you're really hard on me,

462
00:16:00,608 --> 00:16:01,940
你说话时居高临下
and you talk down to me.

463
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:04,040
-你又胡说八道了 -好吧
- You don't know what you're talking about. - Right.

464
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:06,820
当我和你当面对质时 就像现在这样
And when I confronted you, like I am doing now,

465
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:09,820
你无动于衷 就像你现在一样
you were insensitive, like you are being now.

466
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:12,140
我谢谢你给我这个机会
And while I really appreciate the opportunity,

467
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,560
我很爱你
and I do love you very much,

468
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:15,820
但我觉得我们最好不要一起工作
I don't think that working together is a very good idea.

469
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:19,780
好吧
All right, fine.

470
00:16:20,173 --> 00:16:22,663
说实话 我很失望
I'm not gonna lie. I'm very disappointed.

471
00:16:29,556 --> 00:16:31,354
-我们赢了 -太逊了
- We won! - Man, that sucks!

472
00:16:31,354 --> 00:16:33,596
是啊 我们太没男子气概了
Yeah, totally un-masculating.

473
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,460
至少你们玩的时候样子很酷
Well, at least you guys look cool when you play.

474
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:37,580
我们再玩一局 这局就当没发生
Let's play again. This never happened.

475
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:40,440
实际上 我们得去找我们的家人了
Actually, we need to go hang out with our family for a while.

476
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:41,660
真的吗 现在吗
Really? Now?

477
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:43,800
对 但我们不会走远 等会儿见
Yeah, but we'll be around. We'll see you guys.

478
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,940
怎么了 我又做错事了吗
What happened? Did I mess up?

479
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:48,740
-你做得很好 -那他不喜欢我吗
- No, you did great. - So he didn't like me?

480
00:16:48,740 --> 00:16:50,920
-他可喜欢你了 -那我们干嘛要走开
- No, he totally liked you. - Then why'd we walk away?

481
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,340
他本来就不是重点
This was never about him.

482
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:54,160
这是为了给你增加点自信
This was about getting you some confidence.

483
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,960
男生们会意识到你这点的 更优秀的男生
Guys will pick up on that. Better guys.

484
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:57,060
那种即使输给女生
Guys who can lose to a girl

485
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:59,114
也不会觉得有损男子气概的人
without feeling e-masculated.

486
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,940
但愿你以后不会用我接下来的话反击我
Okay, try not to throw this in my face one day,

487
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,140
但我有时觉得你其实挺聪明
but sometimes you're actually really smart.

488
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:09,180
真正意义上的聪明 希望你知道
Like, smart smart. I hope you know that.

489
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:13,520
谢谢
Thanks.

490
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:18,680
我以后当然会拿这话来反击你
And I'm totally throwing that in your face one day.

491
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,380
你开玩笑呢吧
Are you kidding?

492
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:23,860
太感谢了 一切正常吗
Oh, thank you so much. Everything go okay?

493
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:26,000
不 我被困在柜台后面
No. Actually, I was trapped back here,

494
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,540
又跟我爸吵了一架
my dad and I got in a whole thing.

495
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:28,680
现在他生气了
now he's mad at me.

496
00:17:28,738 --> 00:17:30,060
你在哪儿找到那个的
Whoa, where'd you find that?

497
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:31,480
我知道你把啤酒放在哪儿 杰夫
I know where you keep the beer, Jeff.

498
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:33,440
我太恨这感觉了
I hate this feeling!

499
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:36,060
我发誓 这从我12岁那年就开始了
I swear, it started when I was 12 years old

500
00:17:36,060 --> 00:17:37,760
我在社会研究课考试中得了个C
and I got a "C" in social studies.

501
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:39,460
我爸看我的眼神 别人看到会以为
The way my dad looked at me, you would have thought

502
00:17:39,460 --> 00:17:41,080
我穿着抹胸装去了教堂
I'd worn a tube top in church.

503
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,300
他知道我会非常伤心
He knew it crushed me.

504
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:44,020
他不在乎
He didn't care.

505
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:46,200
这就是我不能为他工作的原因
That's why I can't work for him.

506
00:17:46,380 --> 00:17:48,580
他以前对我很严厉 现在也一样会
He was hard on me then. He's gonna be hard on me now.

507
00:17:48,847 --> 00:17:51,893
告诉你 人是不会变的
I'm telling you, people don't change.

508
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:53,000
我改变了
I've changed.

509
00:17:53,253 --> 00:17:54,922
我不想再忍受这些
I don't wanna put up with this stuff.

510
00:17:54,922 --> 00:17:58,453
和20年前相比 我现在完全不一样了
I am a completely different person than I was 20 years ago.

511
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:01,700
孩子们 一共是18.5美元
All right, kids, that's gonna be $18.50.

512
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,840
收20
Out of $20?

513
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:06,380
找你1.5美元
There's your $1.50...

514
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:07,220
我想也是
I thought so.

515
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,700
我想说
Well, I mean,

516
00:18:11,700 --> 00:18:13,960
你跟他说了实话 心里舒服些了吗
do you feel good that you were at least honest with him?

517
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,820
没有 想都别想
No. And... Super no.

518
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:19,020
因为每次我令他失望
Because I'm the one who's left with this awful feeling

519
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:20,140
深感愧疚的人却是我
every time I disappoint him.

520
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:20,960
这不公平
It's not fair.

521
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,178
做恶人的不是我
'cause I'm not the bad guy here.

522
00:18:23,207 --> 00:18:24,633
他需要知道这点
He needs to know that.

523
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,740
怎么样
How's that?

524
00:18:31,146 --> 00:18:33,665
-好些了吗 -好多了
- That better? - Yeah, much better.

525
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:34,980
谢谢你 泰迪
Thank you, Teddy.

526
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,460
你好了 和我去溜冰
You're fixed. Skate with me.

527
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:39,140
我觉得还没好到那种程度 宝贝
I think it's a little soon, sweetie.

528
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:40,020
不 我是叫泰迪
No. Teddy.

529
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:42,080
没问题 孩子
But--oh, sure thing, kiddo.

530
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:44,060
尽量冰敷 三天不要做侧手翻
Hey, lots of ice, no cartwheels for three days.

531
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:46,380
-好的 -准备好了吗 来吧
- Yeah. - Ready? Come on.

532
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:47,900
很好的小伙子
Good guy.

533
00:18:48,202 --> 00:18:50,633
泰迪吗 是啊 他最好了
Who--Teddy? Yeah. Yeah, he's the best.

534
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,220
真不敢相信他居然找不到伴儿
Nuts he can't find anybody, huh?

535
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:55,360
肯定有什么问题
Gotta be something a little off there.

536
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:58,440
反正他没让米奇尔表现出最好的一面
He definitely did not bring out the best in Mitchell,

537
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,560
这点我能肯定
I can tell you that right now.

538
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:00,620
是吗
Oh, really?

539
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:03,140
并不是说这有什么关系
Well, you know, not that it matters...

540
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:04,400
不过能不能说具体些
but in what way exactly?

541
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,360
说实话 他们在一起的时候
Honestly? When they were together,

542
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:08,560
米奇尔相当令人头痛
Mitchell could be a bit of a pill.

543
00:19:08,995 --> 00:19:10,646
我喜欢泰迪
Now, I like Teddy,

544
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:13,920
但他们分手时 其实我有些庆幸
but when they broke up, I was actually kinda glad.

545
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:16,540
当然了 米奇尔觉得
Of course, Mitchell thought that I was

546
00:19:16,540 --> 00:19:18,300
我心里不舒服是因为不接受同性恋
uncomfortable because of the gay thing,

547
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:19,720
也许我当时是的 但是
and maybe I was, but...

548
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,534
我真的只是想让他开心
I really just wanted him to be happy.

549
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,740
像他现在这样
Like he is now.

550
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,940
你们在一起后 大家都想
And when you two started up, everyone thought,

551
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:28,880
就是他了
"Well, there it is."

552
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:33,320
孩子们 双人溜冰开始
Okay, kids. Couples skate.

553
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:36,460
拉上你爱的人 开溜吧
Grab someone you love and get out there.

554
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:38,360
杰 你真是...
Jay, you can be so...

555
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:40,300
-我不会和你溜冰的 小卡 -好吧
- I'm not skating with you, Cam. - Yeah.

556
00:19:40,658 --> 00:19:44,112
我呢 爸 你要和我一起溜冰吗
What about me, dad? You wanna skate with me?

557
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,680
什么样的人才有资格被称为英雄
What qualifies someone as a hero?

558
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:53,980
显然 英雄必须是我们尊敬的人
Obviously, a hero has to be someone we respect.

559
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:56,000
我们敬仰的人
A person we look up to.

560
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:59,540
心胸宽广的人
A person who is generous of spirit.

561
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:04,060
愿意成长与学习的人
Who's willing to grow and learn.

562
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,200
爸
So... Dad,

563
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:08,140
如果提议还有效的话
if that offer still stands...

564
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:10,940
真的吗 为什么改变主意
Really? What changed?

565
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,040
有些事不同了
A couple of things.

566
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:15,100
也许是这世上你最爱的人
Maybe it's the person you love most in the world

567
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:17,680
或是尽力享受生活的人
or the guy who makes the most out of life,

568
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,040
不管别人怎么想
no matter what anyone thinks.

569
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,120
没事的 大家都在笑我
It's cool! No, everybody's laughing at me!

570
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:24,020
-继续溜 机会来了 -不
- Keep rolling! This is your chance! - No! No!

571
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:24,980
太好了
Yeah!

572
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:28,940
-菲尔 -我知道
- Phil! - I know!

573
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:31,620
-不过对我来说 -加油 爸
- For me, though... - Go, dad!

574
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:34,000
我家里的英雄就是我的家人
The hero in my family is my family,

575
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,500
我们在一起才是真英雄
because of who we are together.

576
00:20:44,129 --> 00:20:45,100
C-
C-minus.

577
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,600
作业要求不是这样的
"This was not the assignment."

578
00:20:46,641 --> 00:20:48,520
我告诉你谁不是我的英雄
I'll tell you who is not my hero.

579
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:49,500
丽塔·米克纳布老师
Mrs. Rita Mcnabb.

580
00:20:56,032 --> 00:20:58,542
谢谢 谢谢
Oh, thank you! Thank you!

581
00:20:58,744 --> 00:20:59,840
大家在看什么
What is everybody looking at?

582
00:20:59,840 --> 00:21:01,300
我再说一次也没关系
Oh, I guess I can tell the story one more time.

583
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:03,560
是的 我当时正在生气
Sure, yeah. Well, I was mad about something.

584
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:04,840
我甚至不记得在气什么了
I don't even remember what.

585
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:06,480
我转过身 这一刻
I turned. Now at this point,

586
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:08,340
我更像是野兽 而不是人
I'm more animal than I am man.

587
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:10,180
猛击拳击游戏机
Strike the punching machine,

588
00:21:10,180 --> 00:21:12,580
显然我是打破了什么世界纪录
and apparently I broke some sort of world record.

589
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:14,380
我想我永远不会忘记的就是
I guess the thing that I'll never forget

590
00:21:14,380 --> 00:21:15,700
破纪录时游戏机发出的声音
is the sound that it made.

591
00:21:15,780 --> 00:21:19,000
好像有敲钟声 口哨 汽笛
It was, like, bells and whistles and sirens.

592
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:20,820
不太可能描述清楚
It's impossible to describe.

593
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:22,880
不是吧
Oh, no!

594
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:25,696
这可是我生平打出的第一拳
That was literally the first punch I've ever thrown!

595
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:28,460
你这辈子都不准再见他了
You are never to see him again.

596
00:21:28,580 --> 00:21:29,100
是 我知道
Yes, I know.
